Authors of the Music I Care About Meta-Benchmark (MusICA MetaBench)
====================================================================

This file lists the authors of MusICA MetaBench, the benchmark suite
accompanying the paper "Music I Care About Meta-Benchmark (MusICA MetaBench)"
(submitted to ISMIR 2026).

Authors (in order):

